@startuml
!include <C4/C4_Context>
title L1 - Order Pricing system context (bounded teaching example)
LAYOUT_LEFT_RIGHT()
Person(shopper, "Shopper", "Requests an item price quote")
System(order_pricing, "Order Pricing", "Returns a quote or refusal; never creates an order")
Rel(shopper, order_pricing, "Requests quote / receives result", "Local demonstration request boundary")
note bottom of order_pricing
  Trusted setup supplies Product and Coupon snapshots.
  These data values are not external software systems.
  Tax, shipping, payment and production authentication are out of scope.
end note
SHOW_LEGEND()
@enduml
